# MO-004: Extract an esterification mixture and assay both product pools
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 CH3COOH 0.001mol
add v1 ethanol 0.001mol
react v1 esterification
inspect v1
add v1 water 100mL
new
extract v1 v2 hexane 20mL
inspect
measure v1 chromatograph
measure v2 chromatograph
